        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THE UNIVERSE DIED. THE FIGHT HAS ONLY JUST BEGUN.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to face the end of reality in Chronosurge: Echoes of the Void, an intense roguelite survival game where every decision shapes your destiny. The Void has consumed everything we knew, leaving behind only distorted and hungry echoes of the past. You are the last spark of life, trapped in an arena where reality itself unravels. Your only hope is to master the Chronosurge, a mystical force that transforms chaos into power.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive the Echo of the End</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face infinite hordes of anomalies with unique behaviors, from agile hunters to relentless behemoths. Each wave presents a new challenge, demanding adaptation and strategy to survive. Enemies grow stronger with every passing moment, testing your limits and reflexes in frantic, unforgiving combat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Forge Your Own Power</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create devastating builds by combining dozens of insane upgrades. Transform yourself into a bullet storm, summon black holes to devour your enemies, or bend time to your advantage. Strategic depth lies in your ability to experiment with absurd synergies and find the perfect combination to overcome the challenges of the Void. Minimalist gameplay ensures that action is the focus, with intuitive controls that are easy to learn but brutally difficult to master.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Intense Roguelite Survival: Face endless waves of enemies in dynamic and challenging combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Insane Builds: Combine dozens of upgrades to create unique and devastating synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Adaptive Enemies: Anomalies that evolve and grow stronger with each wave, ensuring a constant challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Minimalist Controls: Full focus on action and strategy, with WASD for movement and mouse to shoot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Cosmic Leaderboards: Compete with other players to etch your name at the top of the rankings (feature to be implemented).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your limits and see how far you can go in the Void. Each match is a new opportunity to surpass your previous records and reach the top of the leaderboards. Will your courage be as infinite as the Void?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THE UNIVERSE DIED. THE FIGHT HAS ONLY JUST BEGUN.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to face the end of reality in Chronosurge: Echoes of the Void, an intense roguelite survival game where every decision shapes your destiny. The Void has consumed everything we knew, leaving behind only distorted and hungry echoes of the past. You are the last spark of life, trapped in an arena where reality itself unravels. Your only hope is to master the Chronosurge, a mystical force that transforms chaos into power.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive the Echo of the End</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face infinite hordes of anomalies with unique behaviors, from agile hunters to relentless behemoths. Each wave presents a new challenge, demanding adaptation and strategy to survive. Enemies grow stronger with every passing moment, testing your limits and reflexes in frantic, unforgiving combat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Forge Your Own Power</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create devastating builds by combining dozens of insane upgrades. Transform yourself into a bullet storm, summon black holes to devour your enemies, or bend time to your advantage. Strategic depth lies in your ability to experiment with absurd synergies and find the perfect combination to overcome the challenges of the Void. Minimalist gameplay ensures that action is the focus, with intuitive controls that are easy to learn but brutally difficult to master.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Intense Roguelite Survival: Face endless waves of enemies in dynamic and challenging combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Insane Builds: Combine dozens of upgrades to create unique and devastating synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Adaptive Enemies: Anomalies that evolve and grow stronger with each wave, ensuring a constant challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Minimalist Controls: Full focus on action and strategy, with WASD for movement and mouse to shoot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Cosmic Leaderboards: Compete with other players to etch your name at the top of the rankings (feature to be implemented).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your limits and see how far you can go in the Void. Each match is a new opportunity to surpass your previous records and reach the top of the leaderboards. Will your courage be as infinite as the Void?</p>",
        "short_description": "Chronosurge Echoes of the Void is an intense roguelite survival game where you forge insane builds to resist infinite hordes of anomalies in a collapsing universe. Master the Chronosurge, adapt your strategy, and test your reflexes to survive the Void and etch your name onto the cosmic leaderboards.",
